      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطُومٌ</span></b>  The <i>lion,</i> (K,) <i>that crushes,</i> or <i>bruises,
everything that he devours;</i> (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطَّامٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْطَمٌ</span></b> . (K.) And A wind (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيح</span>) <i>that
crushes everything.</i> (TA.)

